OL,3,ACyber-security issue hitting sites
OL,4,Aworldwide prompts 'millions' of hacking
OL,5,Aattempts
OL,6,
OL,7,FOrganisations around the world are
OL,8,Fscrambling to fix a critical
OL,9,Fcyber-security flaw that could affect
OL,10,Fmillions of websites
OL,12,FInternet infrastructure platform
OL,13,FCloudflare says it saw "millions" of
OL,14,Fhacking attempts on its network after
OL,15,Fthe vulnerability was revealed - but
OL,16,Fthere's no evidence that these were
OL,17,Fsuccessful
OL,19,FThe researcher who helped to identify
OL,20,Fthe flaw says it is "the most serious"
OL,21,Fissue he has ever found
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/41
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
