OL,3,ACyber-security issue hitting sites
OL,4,Aworldwide prompts 'millions' of hacking
OL,5,Aattempts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Office for Budget Responsibility
OL,8,Ftook its site offline yesterday, as did
OL,9,FNHS Scotland. Some parts of Wikipedia
OL,10,Fwere unavailable, while Amazon says it
OL,11,Fdetected an attempt by hackers to
OL,12,Fexploit the flaws - see more affected
OL,13,Fsites here
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/41
