OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHow Arab parties could hold critical
OL,4,Abalance of power in Israeli election
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I see it as our duty to bring down
OL,7,Fthis extremist government. They treat
OL,8,Fus as second-class," says Arkan Badran,
OL,9,F23, who is with the students giving out
OL,10,Fflyers. "I call on all young men and
OL,11,Fwomen to vote for Arab lists, which
OL,12,Frepresent us, because this is our
OL,13,Ffuture."
OL,15,FMost opinion polls indicate that
OL,16,Fneither Netanyahu and his partners nor
OL,17,Fthe main "Change Bloc", led by
OL,18,Fcentre-right former military chief Gadi
OL,19,FEisenkot, has a clear path to a
OL,20,Fparliamentary majority.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/41
